snippet.textDisplay:
@luisanthonychau Thank you. After learning about the venue’s original purpose and its later repurposing as an ice skating facility, it makes perfect sense why the architecture feels so strange.
Even so, this is almost certainly a CGI recreation of the real venue. Side-by-side comparison with genuine photos makes this obvious: either this video received extreme heavy post-production modification, is fully CGI, or the reference photos I found are inauthentic.
The training footage I’ve seen is far more likely to be real — candid clips of young figure skaters training have no marketing agenda, unlike corporate product demos, which are intentionally polished and misleading by design.

