@abbzsterz You do realize that if there's no one going to the self checkouts and instead long queues are forming at the "human lanes" they're going to revert changes because it's what's in demand, right?
Such stuff doesn't come on its own, such stuff requires actual work and dedication (which includes the inconvenience of long waiting times).

Makes me happy that we don't have self checkouts in our store. We just have carts where you can scan the products you buy (don't even need an account for it) and a cashier will then charge the money (and occasionally do routine checks) with a fast lane for those opting for the carts. Honestly even if they replaced all carts with that cart no one would even loose their job considering how long all the normal lanes are either way, they'd still all be filled and have customers almost all the time at them, lol

